 be effective the British government will  need to be consistent in its approach  and it will need to be prepared for  counter sanctions that's one thing  against the likes of Myanmar  and North Korea but sanction China  though and you better be prepared for a  battle since brexit we've heard the  phrase global Britain a lot but no real  evidence of what that means the  government says that these new Human  Rights ank shion's are proof of global  Britain in action alistair bunker Sky  News at the Foreign Office
 

